WEBVTT

NOTE On-screen visual text only; this approved video has no audio track.

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.700
The model proposes a tool. The application checks identity, permissions and preconditions.

2
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:14.700
Only then does it admit op_42, and the external system can confirm the effect.

3
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:23.000
The conversation reports the observed result. A sentence does not create a booking.

4
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:30.700
Context, session, durable operation and system of record are not the same store.

5
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:37.700
A restart loses ephemeral memory. Operation op_42 must remain discoverable.

6
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:46.000
Reconstruct from durable records and check the external effect, not an earlier sentence.

7
00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:53.700
The user says “wait” while op_42 is running. Spoken output should stop.

8
00:00:53.700 --> 00:01:00.700
Cancelling generation or its local await does not prove the provider cancelled the effect.

9
00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:09.000
When the record confirms the booking, reconcile it. Do not claim a cancellation that never happened.

10
00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:16.700
T12 requested 21:00. T13 changes it to 21:30 before the result arrives.

11
00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:23.700
The late op_42 confirmation still describes a real booking at 21:00.

12
00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:32.000
Persist the fact and check relevance. Do not report it as success for the new request.

13
00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:39.700
The response is lost after sending op_42. The effect is UNKNOWN to the application.

14
00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:46.700
With an idempotent API, the retry keeps the key and refers to the same operation.

15
00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:55.000
Two attempts do not create two effects. Without that contract, reconcile first.

16
00:01:55.700 --> 00:02:02.700
op_42 belongs to a durable workflow, not to a temporary agent’s await.

17
00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:09.700
A handoff changes the active agent; the operation keeps its identity and deadline.

18
00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:19.000
A progress update is not a final result. The owner must complete or reconcile the operation.

